+// The broad call-fusion experiment made almost one thousand larger Wasm
+// modules and lost both 720p timing pairs. Keep the same checked machinery,
+// but spend its code-size budget only on Melee's measured hottest straight-line
+// matrix routine. This address is PSMTXConcat in unmodified USA 1.02.
+bool IsMeleeHotFusionCall(const PPCAnalyst::CodeOp& op)
+{
+  return IsOrdinaryFusionCall(op) && op.branchTo == 0x80342204;
+}
